# autotoolfactory's REAL modules; an encrypt->loadEnv round-trip decrypts correctly; LIVE-ADOPTED (autotoolfactory .env
# committed with 3 encrypted secrets, .env.keys gitignored + NOT tracked, tsc clean; c21ed80). Two live-adoption bugs caught +
# fixed + regression-tested: generatePlatform dropped system.wire (0.2.1); mergeGitignore couldn't un-ignore .env (0.3.1).
# @suluk/platform 0.3.0 (feature) + 0.3.1 (gitignore-transition fix) + 0.3.2 (link-key -> ~/.suluk/settings.json) published.
# 0.3.2 (operator: "reads env from ~/.suluk/settings.json if local — it does that by default"): the generator emits
