# (precedence: SULUK_PRIVATE_KEY env > ~/.suluk/settings.json by path > legacy .env.keys), so local dev/deploy/CI-worktree all
# decrypt from one out-of-git store. Setup flow (scaffold + .env.example) updated: keygen -> link-key -> (rm .env.keys) -> set.
# ROUND-TRIP PROVEN (register, rm .env.keys, readPrivateKey still resolves) + LIVE in autotoolfactory (key in ~/.suluk, tsc
